  "summary_en": "State Council Order No. 839 promulgating the implementing regulations of China's Mineral Resources Law, effective 15 June 2026. It covers mining rights allocation, exploration and extraction permits, ecological restoration, strategic mineral reserves, supervision and penalties. It has no AI or robotics content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
